        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Carpet, knotted in silk pile on silk warps, China, Qing dynasty, probably 18th century"@en , "The carpet is composed of bound edges with stitched down silk. Several pieces assembled for boarder; piece has been cut down for larger piece. Colours are a blend of sky blue, pink, yellow and red with round and triangular floral designs."@en ;
